      "evidenceText": "Quantum of Sollazzo — the data newsletter by @puntofisso est. 2012 · 4,000+ subscribers A weekly best-of in all things data. Quantum of Sollazzo is the data newsletter by Giuseppe Sollazzo/puntofisso : data journalism, data visualization, tools, tutorials, data thinking, and AI, every Tuesday in your inbox. Subscribe — free, weekly Join a community of data people. Subscribe → One click to unsubscribe 4,000 + Subscribers 683 Issues & counting 14 yrs Since 2012 >40 % Opens What's inside / 01 Five sections, one good Tuesday. Topical What's breaking now The week's data stories, picked because they actually argue something. — 01 Tools & Tutorials Things to try out Installables, libraries, tutorials, datasets, command-line tricks. Helpers for data jobs. — 02 Data thinking Essays worth the time Longer reads on data culture, ethics, and craft. Quietly opinionated. — 03 Dataviz & Analysis Charts & interactives Visualisation, analysis, and the occasional argument with a second axis. — 04 AI Past the hype What models do, what they don't, and what that means for data work and society. — 05 Archive / 02 Fourteen years of Tuesdays. Issues 411 → The current run, on Buttondown — every issue since the move. Browse on Buttondown → B Issues 113 — 410 The Mailchimp years. Three hundred Tuesdays, give or take. Mailchimp archive → M Issues 0 — 112 The original TinyLetter. Where it all started, in 2012. TinyLetter archive → T Sponsor / 03 Reach 4,000+ data people who actually read. Sponsor a Tuesday. The list includes data journalists, analysts, viz designers, and engineers who care about data, open source, and AI. One slot per issue; a single, well-written placement that fits the voice of the newsletter. Get in touch and we can discuss options. Sponsorship — at a glance Audience Data people in Data Journalism, viz, analytics, AI & ML, gov, finance, academia, energy Reach 4,000+ subscribers Cadence One slot per issue, weekly Format Native, hand-written placement Ope