      "pageDescription": "What’s shaping our media landscape today? Poynter&#039;s daily newsletter helps you gain a deeper understanding of the latest trends in journalism.",
      "evidenceText": "Subscribe to The Poynter Report - Poynter Subscribe to The Poynter Report - Poynter DONATE What do you want to search? Submit Sign In | Membership News Training Ethics Fact-Checking Media Literacy AI Events Future of Public Media Newmark Ethics Center IFCN MediaWise PolitiFact Donate About Us Press Freedom Watch The Poynter 50 Podcasts Artificial Intelligence Business & Work Reporting & Editing Fact-Checking Ethics & Trust Local News Journalism, Media & Communication Training Poynter Membership Categories Consulting & Coaching For ACES Members For Local News Funders All Categories Broadcast & Visual Journalism Business & Work Ethics Fact-Checking & Media Literacy Leadership Reporting & Editing Writing Poynter ACES Introductory Certificate in Editing Poynter ACES Intermediate Certificate in Editing Poynter ACES Advanced Certificate in Editing Workshops and Coaching Tools for Funders Ethics Ethics Training Ethics Articles AI Ethics Public Editor Project Get Ethics Advice Fact-Checking Articles IFCN IFCN Grants International Fact-Checking Day Teen Creator Network PolitiFact MediaWise Media Literacy Resources AI Literacy Ambassadors Teen Creator Network Research & News International en Español MediaWise Training All Events The 2026 Poynter Journalism Prizes Authoritative insights. Authentic voice. The Poynter Report with Tom Jones is the must-read newsletter for everyone who cares about the media. In 10 minutes, you’ll feel informed and invested in the most relevant media news. Get The Poynter Report in your inbox every weekday morning. Resubscribing to The Poynter Report? Click here . * indicates required Email Address * First Name Last Name The Poynter Report New from The Poynter Report: A big goodbye on ‘Morning Joe’ as Willie Geist prepares to leave MS NOW Tom Jones A wild weekend of travel delays, explanations and excuses Tom Jones Face the changes: Two top leaders are leaving CBS News’ ‘Face the Nation’ Tom Jones What happened at Pete Hegset