      "finalUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/De-JaGqEtqx",
      "contentType": "text/html; charset=\"utf-8\"",
      "pageTitle": "MediaWise (&#064;mediawise) &#x2022; Instagram photos and videos",
      "pageDescription": "30 likes, 1 comments - mediawise on October 26, 2026: &quot;&#x1f30e; What&#x2019;s the biggest media literacy tip we&#x2019;ve learned in 2026?\n\nIn honor of Global Media Literacy Week, media literacy organizations from across the world were convened by MediaWise and developed a 2026 Tip of the Year:\n\n&#x1f4a1; Everyone needs the &#x201c;screen intelligence&#x201d; to pause before believing or sharing something online. But in a world full of AI-generated content, that now has to include understanding how AI works and how it might impact what you&#x2019;re seeing.\n\nThis tip was based on submissions from Global Media Literacy Network members, selected through member voting and revised through collaboration between members. Representatives from organizations on six continents contributed.\n\n#M",
      "evidenceText": "Instagram {\"require\":[[\"ScheduledServerJS\",\"handle\",null,[{\"__bbox\":{\"require\":[[\"PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWCarouselMedia_media$normalization.graphql\"],[\"PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWCarouselMedia.react\"],[\"emptyFunction\",\"thatReturns\",[\"RequireDeferredReference\"],[[{\"__dr\":\"PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWCarouselMedia_media$normalization.graphql\"},{\"__dr\":\"PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWCarouselMedia.react\"}]]],[\"RelayPrefetchedStreamCache\",\"next\",[],[\"adp_PolarisLoggedOutDesktopWWWPostRootContentQueryRelayPreloader_6afd387ab62af2c39106180\",{\"__bbox\":{\"complete\":true,\"result\":{\"data\":{\"xig_polaris_media\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4016689293934385841\",\"code\":\"De-JaGqEtqx\",\"if_not_gated_logged_out\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"profile_pic_url\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.2885-19\\/36517925_428148700998934_6643204329664675840_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=GCU4LQIW7TsjZoUBAAAAAAAkZzFcbkULAAAB1501500j-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=669407&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0\\u00253D&_nc_ohc=PVxw1lp-2vkQ7kNvwFOUyig&_nc_oc=AdqikPBp23geVNfZpWKPz6cIRuDk46p5LjX42SZESo4NXg2ah1wvlImnKAtjOp-W7rA&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUCFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQRN2bq5K6gU10IJ9uQx87WUQ_uumEZGGdEUM52eZZan0g&oe=6B030CD1\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"polaris_ordered_timeline_connection\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"3991924928320222204\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by MediaWise on September 22, 2026.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"\\ud83e\\udd14 Our lives are overflowing with news and information. With so much happening all the time, it\\u2019s difficult to figure out how to understand it all. \\n\\nThere\\u2019s no one right way to consume media, but being conscious about what you do use is one big way to cut down the noise. So what media do folks working in media literacy actually read, listen to and watch? \\n\\nFrom cutting edge tech podcasts to unexpectedly old-school options, here\\u2019s what media literacy specialists at \\u0040mediawise consumed over the weekend. \\n\\n#media #news #medialiteracy #journalist\"},\"code\":\"DdmKpJ6jbP8\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t39.30808-6\\/820239718_1397543535835383_2305411922833134250_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=WMY8vX2hEAkQ7kNvwErlIEo&_nc_oc=Adp03JjCi5ciSkBYlQilxiYhGCl3v6Klhuli4lBBg_WvB10SjqqeLfVGGTgljxBHV70&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQRIb5H66yZjuBoC19L1UHL07IqLFk0tNrfJpiS0cAdvaw&oe=6B02F8BF\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"id\":\"17841408065658787\"},\"carousel_media_count\":7,\"id\":\"POLARIS_3991924928320222204\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"pk\":\"4032630032127191233\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Video by MediaWise on November 17, 2026. May be a video game screenshot of television, screen, newsroom and text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"\\u23ea That\\u2019s a wrap on \\u0040MediaWise\\u2019s first-ever \\u0040TwitchCon convention. \\u23ea\\n\\nWe talked to hundreds of gamers, streamers and creators, handed out free resource guides on building positive online communities and hosted a panel with \\u0040godfree, airie \\u0040airiesummer and \\u0040kleanplays to break down how to tackle toxicity in gaming communities. \\n\\n\\ud83d\\udca1 We met tons of new creators, got feedback directly from the streaming community and left inspired to continue creating resources gamers actually need to combat misinformation and toxicity online. \\n\\nDid you stop by our booth at TwitchCon? Sound off in the comments \\ud83d\\udc47\\n\\nAnd find the panel stream and our free creator resources at the link in our bio. \\n\\n#Twitch #TwitchCon #Streamer #Gamer #Misinformation\"},\"code\":\"Df2x6X_g2jB\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/907282941_18353730787268856_3042328993582497336_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&_nc_ohc=W-Q2JXhF2ZIQ7kNvwHPWM5P&_nc_oc=AdqHyCK6a7Y8XxOiu1Ez2o3OeismL5800SjEp75rKIG0nPMwuW1Mok_HZZkclCdmlKo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQQAAAA&oh=00_AQRlKGPuiP4tBZkIiIyqkqCo7dXhfw46gSUJuFumdILWmQ&oe=6B02FB15\",\"media_type\":2,\"product_type\":\"clips\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"id\":\"17841408065658787\"},\"id\":\"POLARIS_4032630032127191233\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4032434809859458541\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by PolitiFact on November 17, 2026. May be an image of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"A 90-day nationwide blackout is not looming for the U.S., despite social media call outs to prepare for such a doomsday scenario.\\n\\nMultiple TikTok posts say the blackout will start Nov. 17 and warn people to stock up with food and other supplies. A Nov. 14 TikTok post went even farther, showing a manipulated video of President Donald Trump purportedly saying the blackout is coming.\\n\\n\\u201cA 90-day blackout is going to happen before the end of the year,\\u201d Trump appears to say from the White House press briefing room. The video is of a Nov. 9 news conference and Trump didn\\u2019t mention a nationwide power outage.\\n\\nThere is no evidence that is going to happen. FEMA will do a nationwide test of the Emergency Alert System on Nov. 17, which happens at least once every three years.\\n\\nThe Defense Department in late September announced a project to prepare military bases to operate for 90-days in case of a blackout of the civilian electric grid, that doesn\\u2019t mean a blackout is expected Nov. 17.\\n\\nDuring the recent nationwide flights ground stop, the Homeland Security secretary said Americans don\\u2019t need to stockpile for widespread disruptions to power, water and food supplies and that related online claims are unfounded.\\n\\nWe rate this claim False. #misinformation #blackout #emergencyalert #factcheck\"},\"code\":\"Df2FhhFl8Xt\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/907920981_18446964961179502_880153168689367789_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=geo-23UT6nIQ7kNvwH13u6i&_nc_oc=Adqnyq6d9ltqmkA_PPPMI3qMUozTnZSsvVygZNX8jWoPNImXINnmdYh3ZyyrYN-Be-A&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQQGIf8p0h1nprFQI-zEivsR74hZRC1IkHBDGHorCCrPAw&oe=6B031C69\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"5378803501\",\"username\":\"politifact\",\"id\":\"17841405385042350\"},\"carousel_media_count\":2,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4032434809859458541\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"pk\":\"4031742750344208614\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Video by MediaWise on November 16, 2026. May be a selfie of studying, office and text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"Schools must now make a choice \\u2014 accept Google's AI, or cut off Google search access. \\ud83d\\udc40\\ud83d\\udcbb \\n\\nStudents using Google apps in the classroom will not be allowed to access the company\\u2019s search engine unless their school system also opts in to using its AI.\\n\\nK-12 schools now will be able to turn each Google tool on or off \\u2014 including Gemini, Gemini Notebook and search. But because Google's search engine is now integrated with AI, schools that opt out of AI altogether would also lose access to search.\\n\\nHere's what the new policy actually means for students. \\n\\n#Google #AI #Education #MediaLiteracy #DigitalLiteracy\"},\"code\":\"DfzoKucBeDm\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/902585937_18353422039268856_7462324031510799445_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&_nc_ohc=k4NoGe8uYn4Q7kNvwGANHG3&_nc_oc=AdqVmEgDfxU_Qs018UYO_L9pG3s0opSLj7GY7JsfORPzxKN6_44XNM-NnArvPlCe-5k&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQQAAAA&oh=00_AQRMI98s2tGyyjw-Um4kuUNZiY7AcYyAEYsjeJwqH-2iiA&oe=6B030793\",\"media_type\":2,\"product_type\":\"clips\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"id\":\"17841408065658787\"},\"id\":\"POLARIS_4031742750344208614\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4031152925564897187\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by MediaWise on November 15, 2026. May be an image of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"\\ud83d\\udc7e Gamers love their communities, and want less toxicity and disinformation in them. \\n\\nThat\\u2019s where MediaWise\\u2019s G.A.M.E. \\u2014 Gamers Against Manipulation Efforts \\u2014 initiative comes in. Throughout a jam-packed weekend at \\u0040TwitchCon in San Diego, we\\u2019ve provided free resources to hundreds of creators, equipping them with the tools to combat toxicity online. \\n\\n\\ud83e\\udd1d We took to the stage with streamers \\u0040godfree, airie \\u0040airiesummer and \\u0040kleanplays to break down actionable steps to tackle disinformation and build positive online communities. \\n\\nMissed us? Find the panel stream and our free creator resources at the link in our bio. \\n\\n#Twitch #TwitchCon #Streamer #Gamer #Misinformation\"},\"code\":\"DfxiDpTkoej\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/905013151_18353394232268856_4113359028681096874_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=hvzYEbF4MOMQ7kNvwFeZM94&_nc_oc=Adoz-WHCYfaGBYOptb1HNZWo3CfZ35QQaEM8zFUEbAzmr66LBkf5PTKoJoE-EzOG_rk&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQRM5U5nsFmlC-MW6jHQ1v1QNALpsOtmoSBXbJ2HncEUTQ&oe=6B02FEAB\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"id\":\"17841408065658787\"},\"carousel_media_count\":9,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4031152925564897187\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"pk\":\"4030444518037127295\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Video by MediaWise on November 14, 2026. May be a meme of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"\\ud83e\\udd16 You might have seen headlines saying that China's artificial intelligence bubble has burst, and the U.S. could be next.\\n\\nBut what does that really mean \\u2014 and what should everyday consumers expect? We break it down using credible sources and expert analysis. \\n\\n#AI #China #news #technology #AIbubble\"},\"code\":\"DfvA-9YhgB_\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/902585968_18353220103268856_4891771967768058214_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&_nc_ohc=UWkHP0o_nu8Q7kNvwE5C-lo&_nc_oc=Adpmr_PTuJ-zqOZkYpxYmPAcyO2LNJrOekWiIq1sAUJPFktUQZvCT0i0R0urcJGb6sw&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQQAAAA&oh=00_AQSlsXmaWUXCz9vZOQn06Fosmvh4-IEN4xILUE2syShdOQ&oe=6B0326B5\",\"media_type\":2,\"product_type\":\"clips\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"id\":\"17841408065658787\"},\"id\":\"POLARIS_4030444518037127295\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"pk\":\"4030247919860342170\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisImageMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by MediaWise on November 14, 2026. May be a graphic of poster, screen, magazine, mouse pad and text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"\\u2757 We\\u2019re live at \\u0040TwitchCon today \\u2757\\n\\nTune into our conversation, \\u201cStop the trolls: Detox the internet\\u201d at 10:30 a.m. PST (1:30 p.m. EST) on the GivePLZ stage. \\n\\n\\ud83e\\udd1d MediaWise deputy director Brittani Kollar will be joined by \\u0040godfree, \\u0040airiesummer and \\u0040kleanplays to discuss how you can take actionable steps to tackle misinformation and toxicity and build positive online communities.\\n\\nNot in San Diego? We forgive you. Join the discussion via livestream at the link in our bio.\\n\\n#TwitchCon #Gamer #Streaming #Toxic\"},\"code\":\"DfuUSFECF2a\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/902585785_18353126221268856_2375757657691628419_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=8MENl5nvzFMQ7kNvwH2CtuK&_nc_oc=AdrIkOwTNdRcEnhpDK9DPXO17F6WhfiYdGy2bFvxcgvNSgofbQn8_ToHJvDHhlwW-Ss&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQQDInCmRyQt1JbsgyEf-1q2Vxnu6B1dkNDFk4Tjvjrs_A&oe=6B02F2A1\",\"media_type\":1,\"product_type\":\"feed\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"id\":\"17841408065658787\"},\"id\":\"POLARIS_4030247919860342170\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"pk\":\"4029508234142246839\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Photo by MediaWise on November 13, 2026. May be an image of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"MediaWise has touched down at \\u0040TwitchCon in San Diego \\ud83d\\ude0e\\n\\nWe\\u2019re hosting a panel Saturday morning, \\u201cStop the trolls: Detox the Internet,\\u201d featuring \\u0040godfree, \\u0040airiesummer and \\u0040kleanplays on the GivePLS stage. Not in California? You can still tune in to the livestream when the link in our bio goes live at 10:30 a.m. PST\\/1:30 p.m. EST on Saturday.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc4b Make sure to stop by our booth in the Exhibit Hall to pick up some swag and chat with our team who is there to answer all your questions on misinformation, toxicity, and other online challenges.\\n\\n#TwitchCon #Gamer #Streaming #Toxic\"},\"code\":\"DfrsGPDj2e3\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/902585601_18352903000268856_7142220785183285156_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=-D96w0jZNsIQ7kNvwFVG3_C&_nc_oc=AdoHV23gDm8Lbsv36Wc9NxJI-yJGPFiLB29uY_U_kZKYDHnOcQqlszpqyNBDQduV1Iw&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQS959V18zDAkyaO3TZXg05xJWqZL2nP23EL_NGOcIumlg&oe=6B031B7B\",\"media_type\":8,\"product_type\":\"carousel_container\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"id\":\"17841408065658787\"},\"carousel_media_count\":2,\"id\":\"POLARIS_4029508234142246839\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"pk\":\"4028865900366213506\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Video by MediaWise on November 12, 2026. May be a meme of eyeglasses and text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"Have you seen anyone wearing Meta\\u2019s Ray-Ban smart glasses lately? \\ud83d\\udc53\\n\\nThe recording tech was popular when it first launched in 2023, but has since faced criticism and concerns about privacy. This fall, Meta released another edition of the smart glasses \\u2014 this time with no camera, just audio recording. \\n\\nHere\\u2019s the latest. \\n\\n#Meta #Tech #Privacy #RayBan #SmartGlasses\"},\"code\":\"DfpaDDHAzGC\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/902585807_1778654526561916_8462280363975556243_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&_nc_ohc=30iS8PnRuFYQ7kNvwGXaxqa&_nc_oc=AdoHe8A4mqbf66J2feP7PBUEK3YS7irR4jCuY1T3M6kpRUmzn7ex-85Y_0QtwDQ6Emk&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQwAAAA&oh=00_AQQ7Qm_NQIvIV9Lx46piU-l5kzNmIBeUHqjtzMDDYFyXMg&oe=6B031309\",\"media_type\":2,\"product_type\":\"clips\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"id\":\"17841408065658787\"},\"id\":\"POLARIS_4028865900366213506\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"pk\":\"4026911084622687378\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Video by MediaWise on November 09, 2026. May be a graphic of magazine, poster, newspaper, book and text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"AI companies like Anthropic, Meta and OpenAI are buying up tons of old books, tearing off the spines and feeding their data into large language models. \\n\\nAccording to reporting from \\u0040404mediaco and \\u0040washingtonpost, AI companies are in search of more training data to feed their models. So, they're turning to old books \\u2014 because they\\u2019re guaranteed to be free of AI slop.\\n\\nAn internal planning document from Anthropic, which was unsealed early this year in court filings, revealed the company\\u2019s plan to \\u201cdestructively scan all the books in the world.\\u201d\\n\\n#AI #Anthropic #BookTok #News #AISlop\"},\"code\":\"DfidkvFBKyS\",\"seo_canonical_url\":null,\"display_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\\/v\\/t51.82787-15\\/900005152_18352449961268856_3710195315570429039_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ\\u00253D\\u00253D&_nc_ohc=9eiDO6xLr6cQ7kNvwFlxwDU&_nc_oc=AdqXS4tOfauc9k7_18kDv8_GUwFbmEZY85X1WSi0AkCTjbjR_R01XZQp7ow5SJZcgSw&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Ae18T0IBIJKMZW4LewQ4lw&_nc_ss=7c689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQQAAAA&oh=00_AQRXjHY60qw0wI4yOkb9xAuhL4z74HnMrvGgGdZM_ipauA&oe=6B030B02\",\"media_type\":2,\"product_type\":\"clips\",\"user\":{\"pk\":\"7990300855\",\"username\":\"mediawise\",\"id\":\"17841408065658787\"},\"id\":\"POLARIS_4026911084622687378\"}},{\"node\":{\"__typename\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"pk\":\"4024465191780760517\",\"__isXIGPolarisMedia\":\"XIGPolarisVideoMedia\",\"accessibility_caption\":\"Video by MediaWise on November 06, 2026. May be a meme of text.\",\"caption\":{\"text\":\"\\u26a0\\ufe0f Those comments might mean more than you think. \\n\\nHere\\u2019s how to recognize and understand dog whistles on social media, or veiled messages that are used to communicate hateful, racist or discriminatory conspiracies. \\n\\n#dogwhistle #t